WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.457
Were you unemployed last week?

2
00:00:02.457 --> 00:00:03.846
Or last year?

3
00:00:03.846 --> 00:00:06.188
The answer changes India's jobless

4
00:00:06.188 --> 00:00:07.113
rate.

5
00:00:07.441 --> 00:00:09.160
Usual status asks what you

6
00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:10.762
mostly did over the past

7
00:00:10.762 --> 00:00:13.177
