14
00:00:25.927 --> 00:00:28.405
Labour force participation counts those

15
00:00:28.405 --> 00:00:30.523
working or looking for work.

16
00:00:30.523 --> 00:00:32.239
The unemployment rate is the

17
00:00:32.239 --> 00:00:33.845
